  "intro": {
    "title": "Meine Geschwister",
    "paragraphs": [
      "Most family words are close to English: Vater, Mutter, Bruder, Sohn. Two useful ones have no English twin: die Geschwister (brothers and sisters together) and die Eltern (parents).",
      "Cousin and Cousine come from French and keep the French sound. Grandchildren are Enkel (boy) and Enkelin (girl)."
    ]
  },
